        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <h3>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Asia Pacific Women\u2019s 84+kgs Powerlifting Champion\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://irp.cdn-website.com/002b888d/dms3rep/multi/Riria+R2.jpg\" alt=\"\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Riria Ropata on the podium with the Tino Rangatira flag\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           28 July 2025\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Riria Ropata, p\u016bkenga for the Poutuarongo Kawa Oranga programme - Bachelor of Health Promotion, Sport and Exercise Science at Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa has come away with gold again. Earlier this month \u2013 5-13 July 2025 Riria competed at the Asian African Pacific Powerlifting and Bench Press Championships held in Himeji, Japan. There she competed in the women\u2019s 84+kgs weight class and won:\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            back squat female with 237.5 kgs\u00a0\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            bench press female with 120 kgs\u00a0\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            dead lift female with 247.5 kgs.\u00a0\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Well done Riria!\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           For previous stories about Riria, check out\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"https://www.wananga.com/competing-at-the-commonwealth-powerlifting-championships-2024\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           Competing at the Commonwealth Powerlifting Championships 2024\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            \u00a0and\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"https://www.wananga.com/world-powerlifting-champion-and-pukenga-at-te-wananga-o-raukawa\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           World Powerlifting Champion and P\u016bkenga at Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           If you would like to know about the Poutuarongo Kawa Oranga programme, click on the link below\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"https://www.wananga.com/bachelor-of-health-promotion-sport-and-exercise-sciences\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           Kawa Oranga-Bachelor Health Promotion, Sport &amp; Exercise Sciences\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
      }
